        "aspectRatio": "16:9"
      }
    },
    {
      "component": "StrategyCard",
      "props": {
        "title": "Story First, Then the Name",
        "content": "Our approach would be to define the problem the category solves and the idea it owns before we generate names. A name that follows a clear narrative can stand on its own, while one built from the platform's feature list tends to read as a feature.",
